Hmm. And your robots are nothing but

01:30:20.780 --> 01:30:23.450
puppets. Huh. Real nice.

01:30:23.950 --> 01:30:25.630
Takes all kinds to make a world,

01:30:25.750 --> 01:30:27.470
huh? I'm Tom Servo reporting.

01:30:27.630 --> 01:30:28.090
Maria!

01:30:30.410 --> 01:30:32.570
Oh, I didn't know he could bend that far.

01:30:32.870 --> 01:30:33.960
What do you think, sirs?

01:30:34.230 --> 01:30:36.250
I don't understand it, Frank.

01:30:36.610 --> 01:30:38.170
This movie should have broken their will.

01:30:38.350 --> 01:30:41.310
It should have reduced Joel's brain case to a peat pot.

01:30:41.490 --> 01:30:43.410
Encouraged the bots to rip their own heads off,

01:30:43.510 --> 01:30:44.570
and yet they thrive on it.

01:30:44.710 --> 01:30:47.230
They're growing larger, more confident.

01:30:48.240 --> 01:30:51.440
You know, sometimes I wish I was one of those little guys up there,

01:30:51.620 --> 01:30:53.300
quipping away, gadding about.

01:30:53.680 --> 01:30:56.930
I wonder how you go to the bathroom up in space.

01:30:57.690 --> 01:30:59.740
Frank, hand me my microphone.

01:31:02.400 --> 01:31:04.020
DEEP HURTING!
